BT 1 0 0 1 0 74.5 Tm 1.18441 Tw 14 TL 0 0 0 rg /F3+0 9.5 Tf 14 TL (The ) Tj /F2+0 9.5 Tf 14 TL (Document Object Model \(DOM\)) Tj /F3+0 9.5 Tf 14 TL ( is a programming interface provided by the browser for) Tj T* 0 Tw .755912 Tw (HTML documents. When a page loads, the browser parses the HTML and builds a tree of objects) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.108257 Tw (called nodes) Tj (: the ) Tj /F4 9.5 Tf (document) Tj /F3+0 9.5 Tf 14 TL ( is the root, every tag becomes an element node) Tj (, every attribute) Tj T* 0 Tw .292045 Tw (becomes an attribute node and every piece of text becomes a text node) Tj (. JavaScript can read and) Tj T* 0 Tw .401054 Tw (modify this tree, and the browser instantly re-renders the page to match. Hence the page can be) Tj T* 0 Tw (changed without reloading.) Tj T* ET
