BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm .518582 Tw 14 TL 0 0 0 rg /F2+0 9.5 Tf 14 TL (Express.js) Tj /F3+0 9.5 Tf 14 TL ( is a minimal and flexible web application framework for Node.js. It simplifies creating) Tj T* 0 Tw .825377 Tw (servers and handling HTTP requests. The framework is installed with ) Tj /F4 9.5 Tf (npm install express) Tj /F3+0 9.5 Tf 14 TL ( and) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.357234 Tw (loaded using ) Tj /F4 9.5 Tf (require\("express"\)) Tj /F3+0 9.5 Tf 14 TL (. Calling ) Tj /F4 9.5 Tf (express\(\)) Tj /F3+0 9.5 Tf 14 TL ( returns an application object \(usually) Tj T* 0 Tw (named ) Tj /F4 9.5 Tf (app) Tj /F3+0 9.5 Tf 14 TL (\) used to define routes and start the server.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
