BT 1 0 0 1 0 60.5 Tm 2.412588 Tw 14 TL 0 0 0 rg /F3+0 9.5 Tf 14 TL (The response is sent using ) Tj /F4 9.5 Tf (res.send\(\)) Tj /F3+0 9.5 Tf 14 TL ( \(text or HTML\) or ) Tj /F4 9.5 Tf (res.json\(\)) Tj /F3+0 9.5 Tf 14 TL ( \(converts a JavaScript) Tj T* 0 Tw .867563 Tw (object/array to JSON and sets the header Content-Type: application/json\). Routes are checked in) Tj T* 0 Tw .854716 Tw (the order in which they are written, so a middleware written with ) Tj /F4 9.5 Tf (app.use\(\)) Tj /F3+0 9.5 Tf 14 TL ( after all the routes) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.245604 Tw (runs only when no route matches; it is used here to return the status ) Tj /F4 9.5 Tf (404) Tj /F3+0 9.5 Tf 14 TL ( \(Not Found\). Finally,) Tj T* 0 Tw /F4 9.5 Tf (app.listen\(PORT, callback\)) Tj /F3+0 9.5 Tf 14 TL ( starts the server on the given port \(3000\).) Tj T* ET
